msgid "A floating pill of workspace icons. It replaces the side pane rather than joining it: while the dock is shown the side pane is hidden, and switching the dock off gives the side pane straight back. Independent of the desk layout: a layout preset writes this setting, it no longer decides it. Applies site-wide on the next page load."
